.Dd June 06, 2026
.Os Linux
.Dt MPNP 1 LOCAL
.Sh NAME
.Nm mpnp
.Nd print information of the currently playing song in mploop
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm mpnp
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm mpnp
is a tool to print information of the current playing song in the
.Xr mploop 1
music player.
.Sh "EXIT STATUS"
.Nm mpnp
exits with zero exit status for success. If there's an error such as
invoking
.Nm mpnp
with unsupported command-line arguments, it returns with a nonzero
exit status.
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Nm mpnp
uses the following environment variables:
.Pp
.Bl -column HOME -compact
.It Ev HOME Ta the home directory of the user
.El
.Sh "SEE ALSO"
.Xr mploop 1
.Sh HISTORY
.Xr mploop 1
was created in September to November 2023. It has been maintained since.
.Sh DISTRIBUTION
.Xr mploop 1
is available at https://github.com/jmtilli/mploop
.Sh BUGS
No bugs known in
.Nm mpnp .
